{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07714","headline":"家园卧疾毕太祝曜见寻 · 孟浩然","name":"家园卧疾毕太祝曜见寻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伏枕旧游旷，笙簧劳梦思。\n平生重交结，迨此令人疑。\n冰室无煖气，炎云空赫曦。\n隙驹不暂驻，日听凉蝉悲。\n壮图哀未立，斑白恨吾衰。\n夫子自南楚，缅怀嵩汝期。\n顾予衡茅下，兼致禀物资。\n脱分趋庭礼，殷勤伐木诗。\n脱君车前鞅，设我园中葵。\n斗酒须寒兴，明朝难重持。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07714.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07714","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}